About 2/3 of the way down the weapons spoiler is a chart describing
the hit/dam bonuses for all ranges of str
(http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/weap-341.txt).  Carrying
capacity also depends on STR and CON.

The second part of the number (after the slash) is called the
percentile score, and comes from AD&D.  As for a good explanation,
think of it as a fractional improvement in STR.  18/01 -> 18/02 isn't
as good as 17 -> 18.  IMO, it's a rather dumb idea, but one that has a
historical basis in RPGs from way back.

